<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Task Reminder</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .header {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #2c3e50;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #2980b9;
        }
        .content {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .task-info {
            background: #ecf0f1;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border: 1px solid #bdc3c7;
            color: #333;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: #2980b9;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .button:hover {
            background: #3498db;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #2980b9;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                width: 90%;
                padding: 25px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header"> Task Reminder </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello, {{User Name}}</p>
            <p>You have a pending task:</p>
            <p style="color: tomato;">Neither Urgent nor Important</p>
            <div class="task-info">
                <strong>Go to School</strong><br>
                Due Date: <strong>2025-12-03</strong><br>
                Due Time: <strong>10:34 PM</strong>
            </div>
            <p>Please complete it as soon as possible.</p>
            <a href="{{task_url}}" class="button">View Task</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2025 Your Company | This is an automated message, do not reply.<br>
            <p>Need help? <a href="mailto:support@yourcompany.com">Contact Support</a></p>
            <p><a href="{{unsubscribe_url}}">Unsubscribe</a> from notifications.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
